Package: sifusion
Title: SafeInsights Fusion SDK
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("SafeInsights", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"), email = "support@safeinsights.org"))
Description: Researcher-facing client for the SafeInsights Enclave Fusion
    Framework. A destination-side analysis calls fusion_request() on a peer
    handle; a source-side container registers Data-Partner-approved operation
    handlers and calls fusion_serve(). The package drives the per-job Fusion
    Tunnel App's enclave-local API (submit/poll, duplicate suppression,
    single in-flight round per peer, typed errors, budget hints) and owns
    the language-neutral fusion envelope shared with the Python package.
License: AGPL (>= 3)
URL: https://github.com/safeinsights/fusion-sdk
BugReports: https://github.com/safeinsights/fusion-sdk/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Language: en-US
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    curl,
    jsonlite
Suggests:
    pkgload,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    tibble,
    withr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
